{"overview":"وقتی لرد موراشیگه علیه اویدای ستمگر قیام می‌کند، خود را محاصره‌شده در دیوارهای قلعه‌اش می‌یابد؛ در تنهایی، با سلسله‌ای از جنایات مرموز که نظم نازک دربارش را می‌شکند مواجه می‌شود و مجبور می‌شود به توافق ناآرامی با کانبی کورودا، استراتژیست نابغه اما خطرناک که در زیرزمین زندانی است، دست بزند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When Lord Murashige rises up against the tyrannical Oda, he finds himself besieged within the walls of his own castle. Isolated, he is confronted with a series of mysterious crimes that shatter the fragile order of his court, forcing him into an uneasy alliance with Kanbei Kuroda, a brilliant yet dangerous strategist held prisoner in the dungeon.","tagline_en":"","runtime":147,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["黒沢清"],"crew_en":["Kiyoshi Kurosawa"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"本木雅弘","role":"Araki Murashige","photo":"/2W5391NRFyhvCZgtR2drmc9VIrh.jpg","en":"Masahiro Motoki"},{"name":"ماساکی سودا","role":"Kuroda Kanbei","photo":"/g7gXu0bE9jZ5LHjSqn1zHdNtiA1.jpg","en":"Masaki Suda"},{"name":"یوریکو یوشی‌تاکا","role":"Chiyoho","photo":"/YJfw7d3ZbHyfLoeKnNBnKN0aRo.jpg","en":"Yuriko Yoshitaka"},{"name":"مونه‌تاکا آئوکی","role":"Araki Kyuzaemon","photo":"/l5GdFPBBz717Kiimyqp5ieaglVo.jpg","en":"Munetaka Aoki"},{"name":"宮舘涼太","role":"Inui Sukesaburo","photo":"/qO2kHuz4GfwdupjIMPmjKB6q0ID.jpg","en":"Ryota Miyadate"},{"name":"柄本佑","role":"Saika Sagehari","photo":"/8XyxsIKNuvwTSCnfXzlN6Bmc5aO.jpg","en":"Tasuku Emoto"},{"name":"オダギリジョー","role":"Koori Juemon","photo":"/jjbwOodtQeVcTwO9oUbLOGjjHDP.jpg","en":"Joe Odagiri"},{"name":"中山裕介","role":"Akioka Shironosuke","photo":"/lEIR4wJHwT4dONG7yYk5kLsgUGg.jpg","en":"Yusuke Santamaria"},{"name":"吉原光夫","role":"Kawarabayashi Notonyudo","photo":"/plFu5yi71UA9HSSNRPbNVD3MTDf.jpg","en":"Mitsuo Yoshihara"},{"name":"坂東龍汰","role":"Kitagawara Yosaku","photo":"/4UmfIDAvQsP8G9BdeWxBwmEq9wm.jpg","en":"Ryota Bando"},{"name":"荒川良々","role":"Muhen","photo":"/hUBEfo9d3voCLkiXKcLSnUz5zRa.jpg","en":"